From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:49:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] power: supply: iceland-supervooc: add a CREDITS file

Name the primary author (dappermint), DocZ13 (SC8547D handover, issue #2) and
OnePlus (oplus_chg), list the iceland changes on top and the licence state of
each file (tests/ has no SPDX lines).

Based on dappermint/iceland-supervooc commit 614469fabe59 ("ci: run the host tests on every push");
builds on DocZ13's SC8547D handover in iceland-linux issue #2 and on OnePlus's open-source oplus_chg code.

Link: https://github.com/dappermint/iceland-supervooc

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 .../power/supply/iceland-supervooc/CREDITS    | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/power/supply/iceland-supervooc/CREDITS

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/iceland-supervooc/CREDITS b/drivers/power/supply/iceland-supervooc/CREDITS
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000..9360dbb98b900
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/iceland-supervooc/CREDITS
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+iceland-supervooc in the iceland kernel tree - credits
+
+Primary author: dappermint (github.com/dappermint, git identity "millia ampora"),
+  https://github.com/dappermint/iceland-supervooc - the driver, the VOOC frame engine (vooc_logic.h),
+  the host tests and the stock i2c traces. Imported here with his three commits unchanged (34234b8,
+  2daacb4, 614469f; GPL-2.0, see LICENSE). His commits carry no Signed-off-by: upstream submission
+  would need his DCO.
+DocZ13: the SC8547D PPS driver and the pump facts of iceland-linux issue #2, on which the handover builds.
+OnePlus: the open-source oplus_chg code (oplus_ap_voocphy.c) the frame engine follows; OnePlus copyright
+  lines in derived code are kept.
+
+Iceland changes on top (separate commits, by mzak): built as a module that never autoloads and refuses to
+load without enable=1; session end 85 % (dappermint: 90 %); CPU latency request 0 (dappermint: 400 us);
+auth_gate=1 by default; a build-time assert of the 7.3 A ceiling; the battmgr charge pump hold readable
+at /sys/module/qcom_battmgr/parameters/oplus_pump_hold. The thermal guards are dappermint's, unchanged
+(connector 60 C, pump step-down 66 C, pump limit 70 C, his taper / ladder). The stock connector cut and
+cool-down stay enforced by iceland-battery-guard in user space, independent of this driver.
+
+Licence: GPL-2.0 (LICENSE). iceland_supervooc.c and vooc_logic.h carry SPDX GPL-2.0 headers; the files
+under tests/ carry no SPDX line (covered only by the repository's LICENSE file).
-- 
